{"id": "yuki-personal-pc-studio", "status": "published", "category": "創業經歷", "title": "Yuki Personal PC Studio", "subtitle": "人生中的第一次電商創業，也是最讓我驕傲的一次。", "cover": {"src": "/assets/experience/cover-yuki-studio.png", "width": 596, "height": 493, "scale": 1, "srcset": "/assets/responsive/cover-yuki-studio-40642fc69d12-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/cover-yuki-studio-40642fc69d12-596.webp 596w"}, "html": "<section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>從需求缺口找到機會</h3><p>疫情讓課程轉為線上，學生開始購買電腦與周邊。我到秋葉原購物時，注意到部分在日華人難以用日文清楚表達需求，最後只能選擇已組好的電腦。這讓我看到一個機會：提供能用中文溝通、依需求客製的組裝服務。</p></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>從自學到第一個電商事業</h3><p>奶茶店營運受疫情影響後，我開始透過 YouTube 自學電腦組裝，約一個月後開始經營面向在日華人的電腦工作室，提供依需求客製的組裝服務。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-motherboard-assembly.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-motherboard-assembly.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-motherboard-assembly-bb8dac6ff344-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-motherboard-assembly-bb8dac6ff344-544.webp 544w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"主機板、記憶體與處理器水冷頭的組裝紀錄。\" width=\"544\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>主機板、記憶體與處理器水冷頭的組裝紀錄。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-component-stock.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-component-stock.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-component-stock-bee300e23a82-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-component-stock-bee300e23a82-542.webp 542w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"處理器、主機板與顯示卡等零組件。\" width=\"542\" height=\"719\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>處理器、主機板與顯示卡等零組件。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-parts-delivery.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-parts-delivery.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-parts-delivery-d2509446c35b-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-parts-delivery-d2509446c35b-541.webp 541w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"機殼與零組件包裝箱的配送現場紀錄。\" width=\"541\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>機殼與零組件包裝箱的配送現場紀錄。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-cpu-memory-assembly.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-cpu-memory-assembly.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-cpu-memory-assembly-fe3b0932f47a-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-cpu-memory-assembly-fe3b0932f47a-548.webp 548w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"處理器、主機板與記憶體的組裝細節。\" width=\"548\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>處理器、主機板與記憶體的組裝細節。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-in-progress-custom-build.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-in-progress-custom-build.png\" alt=\"客製主機的組裝過程與當時的貼文紀錄。\" width=\"417\" height=\"719\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>客製主機的組裝過程與當時的貼文紀錄。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-white-case-assembly.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-white-case-assembly.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-white-case-assembly-dd150bee1371-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-white-case-assembly-dd150bee1371-695.webp 695w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"白色機殼內部的組裝與走線紀錄。\" width=\"695\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>白色機殼內部的組裝與走線紀錄。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>調整獲客方式與定位</h3><p>工作室剛開始時，客源與利潤都是挑戰。我研究在日華人的消費習慣，並透過微信等他們常用的平台宣傳，持續調整文案與接觸客戶的方式。</p><p>經營一段時間後，我將定位逐漸轉向高端客製電腦。這不只是更換商品，而是連同服務方式、Logo、文案和廣告一起調整，加入個人元素與當時的電競視覺風格。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-custom-water-cooled-pc.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-custom-water-cooled-pc.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-custom-water-cooled-pc-90c9381cb847-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-custom-water-cooled-pc-90c9381cb847-542.webp 542w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"客製水冷主機的組裝成品。\" width=\"542\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>客製水冷主機的組裝成品。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-high-end-components.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-high-end-components.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-high-end-components-a3eef80f5b4b-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-high-end-components-a3eef80f5b4b-542.webp 542w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"高階客製電腦的零組件搭配。\" width=\"542\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>高階客製電腦的零組件搭配。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-royal-elite-memory-detail.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-royal-elite-memory-detail.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-royal-elite-memory-detail-c49e38fe98a7-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-royal-elite-memory-detail-c49e38fe98a7-555.webp 555w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"高階記憶體零件與工作室品牌名片。\" width=\"555\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>高階記憶體零件與工作室品牌名片。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>最讓我驕傲的第一次電商創業</h3><p>這是我第一次把需求觀察、技術學習、行銷與日常營運串在一起經營的電商事業。我從中學到，了解顧客如何表達需求、在哪裡尋找服務，以及為什麼願意信任我，和組裝技術本身一樣重要。</p><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-graphics-card-stock.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-graphics-card-stock.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-graphics-card-stock-b95977db9035-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-graphics-card-stock-b95977db9035-540.webp 540w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"工作室內的盒裝顯示卡與品牌名片。\" width=\"540\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>工作室內的盒裝顯示卡與品牌名片。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-workspace-inventory.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-workspace-inventory.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-workspace-inventory-cce4c9027168-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-workspace-inventory-cce4c9027168-543.webp 543w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"工作空間與零組件備貨紀錄。\" width=\"543\" height=\"719\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>工作空間與零組件備貨紀錄。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-workbench-components.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-workbench-components.png\" srcset=\"/assets/responsive/yuki-workbench-components-745998e22548-480.webp 480w, /assets/responsive/yuki-workbench-components-745998e22548-541.webp 541w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 90vw, 440px\" alt=\"工作桌、貨架與零組件。\" width=\"541\" height=\"718\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>工作桌、貨架與零組件。</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"note-article-section\"><h3>出貨與社群互動紀錄</h3><div class=\"note-gallery note-gallery-inline note-gallery-compact\"><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-dispatch-cart.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-dispatch-cart.png\" alt=\"裝箱後交由配送人員收件的出貨紀錄。\" width=\"461\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>裝箱後交由配送人員收件的出貨紀錄。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-packed-orders.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-packed-orders.png\" alt=\"貼妥配送標籤的主機包裝箱。\" width=\"470\" height=\"720\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>貼妥配送標籤的主機包裝箱。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-courier-collection.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-courier-collection.png\" alt=\"配送人員收取包裝箱的現場照片。\" width=\"461\" height=\"717\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>配送人員收取包裝箱的現場照片。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-community-inquiries-2021.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-community-inquiries-2021.png\" alt=\"2021 年 4 月 14 日的社群詢價與互動截圖。\" width=\"321\" height=\"686\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>2021 年 4 月 14 日的社群詢價與互動截圖。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-customer-payment-chat.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-customer-payment-chat.png\" alt=\"客戶付款與互動截圖。\" width=\"414\" height=\"724\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>客戶付款與互動截圖。</figcaption></figure><figure><a href=\"/assets/experience/yuki-account-statement-2020.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/experience/yuki-account-statement-2020.png\" alt=\"2020 年帳單與工作室貼文紀錄。\" width=\"338\" height=\"691\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\"></a><figcaption>2020 年帳單與工作室貼文紀錄。</figcaption></figure></div></section>", "pending": "完整文章準備中。", "close": "關閉"}